    "type": "card",
    "attributes": {
      "name": "Survey Lab",
      "summary": "Research interviews as a conversation. Write a brief and an AI interviewer (Mei, Sam or Pip, each with a talking portrait) chats with each participant, follows up on real moments, and pulls up question tools when talk isn't enough: quick picks, scales and ladders, this-or-that rankings, recall, a haggle for price, **Picture it** (describe something, the AI draws it, change it until it feels right) and **Watch it** (react to a video, camera optional, read on the device). A study designer sets how each study runs, from a warm self-reflection that shows people their result to neutral product research that only says thanks. Every interview keeps a living dossier and an honest running verdict, and the **Study Analysis** whiteboard lets you ask an analyst questions and watch it present the answers. Comes with two studies: *Which of the 16 types are you?* and *Our Taste Test* (18 app screens, three of them videos; videos stay on the source workspace).",
